# Permanent Project Rules

## Brand spelling

Customer-facing Arabic brand name must always be exactly:
`اصول التميز`

Customer-facing English brand name must always be exactly:
`Osool Altamaioz`

Never write `أصول التميز`.
Never invent another English transliteration.
Technical slug: `osool-altamaioz`.

## UX / design

Figma source of truth:
https://www.figma.com/design/BN6SR5KcdPaS6u4qCxY3iN

Arabic is primary RTL; English is LTR. Both desktop and mobile require feature parity.
Do not replace the approved design with a generic template.

## Business-critical data

Never guess official selling prices, stock, warranty, shipping times or technical specifications.
Never expose supplier/cost pricing.
Never fake payment activation or merchant approval.

## Engineering

Inspect existing files before creating/replacing architecture.
Use reusable components and structured product variants.
Keep commerce/security-critical calculations server/platform authoritative.
Run typecheck/lint/build after major phases and fix errors before marking them done.
Update `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md` as work progresses.
